     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>hello all,</div><div> Here is a very good opening at Smithsonian Conservation Biology Institute in Front Royal VA, about an hour west of D.C.</div><div>regards</div><div>andy</div><div> </div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr\"> </div><div style=\"direction:ltr\"><br></div><div style=\"direction:ltr\"><br></div><div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:black\">\r\n<b>Subject:</b> Ecological Data Scientist: IS-1560-12</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:black\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:white;margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15px;color:rgb(36,36,36)\">Good morning,</span></p>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:white;margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;font-size:15px;color:rgb(36,36,36)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:white;margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em;font-size:15px;color:rgb(36,36,36)\">\r\nWe’re excited to share that a new<b> Data Scientist </b>position is now open and accepting applications until\r\n<b>May 18, 2026</b>. </div>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:white;margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15px;color:rgb(36,36,36)\">Interested individuals can review the job description and apply through the link below:<b> </b></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:white;margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15px;color:rgb(36,36,36)\"><b>Apply here:</b> </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.5pt;color:blue\"><a href=\"https://trustcareers.si.edu/postings/c63eac2b-a263-43eb-9c92-50832fe3ecd8\" title=\"https://trustcareers.si.edu/postings/c63eac2b-a263-43eb-9c92-50832fe3ecd8\" style=\"color:blue;margin:0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://trustcareers.si.edu/postings/c63eac2b-a263-43eb-9c92-50832fe3ecd8&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492478495000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3-3FH2CttqX4mfgyPHYbyq\"><u>https://trustcareers.si.edu/postings/c63eac2b-a263-43eb-9c92-50832fe3ecd8</u></a></span><span style=\"font-size:15px;color:rgb(36,36,36)\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:white;margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15px;color:rgb(36,36,36)\">Please feel free to share this opportunity with qualified colleagues or within your networks.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:white;margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15px;color:rgb(36,36,36)\"> </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:white;margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:12pt\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15px;color:rgb(36,36,36)\">Thank you,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:left;text-indent:0px;background-color:white;margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:1em\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:15px;color:rgb(36,36,36)\">Jared</span></p>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black\">\r\n--</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black\">\r\nJared Stabach, Ph.D.</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black\">\r\nEcologist &amp; Head - Conservation Technology &amp; Innovation</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black\">\r\nSmithsonian’s National Zoo &amp; Conservation Biology Institute</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black\">\r\n1500 Remount Road</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black\">\r\nFront Royal, VA  22630</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black\">\r\nT: <a href=\"tel:(540)%20635-6578\" value=\"+15406356578\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">540 635 6578</a> | Email: <a href style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">\r\nstab...@si.edu</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Aptos,Aptos_EmbeddedFont,Aptos_MSFontService,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:black\">\r\nWebsite: <a href=\"https://movementoflife.si.edu/\" style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://movementoflife.si.edu/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492478495000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0CPgt06334YyFNM3dCNqlg\">\r\nhttps://movementoflife.si.edu/</a></div>\r\n<p style=\"direction:ltr;margin:0px;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\">\r\n </p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n</div></div></div>\r\n"
